{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>ואני</b> — R. Moses said: this is the meaning of 'And it came to pass, when the king sat in his house' — as Nathan answered him: 'all that is in your heart, He has done.' This is far-fetched. The correct interpretation: when it befalls a healthy person in his body and his strength, that he thinks it will always be so and no illness will come upon him, so that his strength fails."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:58.236758170Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}